guide polestar-completionist-horde/attune-mallet
title Mallet of Zul'Farrak (Zul'Farrak key or item) (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Dungeons
levels 1-60
zone Tanaris
pitch Mallet of Zul'Farrak: Rings the gong by the sacred pool in Zul'Farrak to call Gahz'rilla; one mallet does it for the group. Qiaga the Keeper (elite) on top of the Altar of Zul in the Hinterlands drops the Sacred Mallet: use it at the altar at the very top of Jintha'Alor and it becomes the Mallet of Zul'Farrak. Both places are full of elites.
why Rings the gong by the sacred pool in Zul'Farrak to call Gahz'rilla; one mallet does it for the group. Qiaga the Keeper (elite) on top of the Altar of Zul in the Hinterlands drops the Sacred Mallet: use it at the altar at the very top of Jintha'Alor and it becomes the Mallet of Zul'Farrak. Both places are full of elites.

step Mallet of Zul'Farrak
  tip Rings the gong by the sacred pool in Zul'Farrak to call Gahz'rilla; one mallet does it for the group. Qiaga the Keeper (elite) on top of the Altar of Zul in the Hinterlands drops the Sacred Mallet: use it at the altar at the very top of Jintha'Alor and it becomes the Mallet of Zul'Farrak. Both places are full of elites. No quest gives it: it comes from inside Zul'Farrak; the arrow leads to the entrance.
  zone map 1446
  collect 9240 x1 @39.8,21.8 map 1446 optional
